Has anyone written code to fix the bug so one can stop eating when attacked
by a monster?  If so, a posting would be greatly appreciated.

Also, I've noticed that paralyzed monsters can wake up if you attack them.
I verified it in the source code.  Does anyone think a patch should be written
to allow the player a chance to recover from paralyzation upon being attacked?

The above was motivated by the untimely death of a character who tried to
cast a fireball at a floating eye while standing adjacent.  An accidental
"z" instead of "Z" got a:

"You hit the floating eye.  You are frozen by the floating eye's gaze!"

"The leucrotta hits!  The killer bee misses!  The killer bee stings! -more-"
<repeat as necessary>

"You die..."

Ed


